# Trivy ignore list for DentistDSS.
#
# Format: one finding per line —
#   <ID> <component>   # <rationale> — review-by <YYYY-MM-DD>
#
# Policy: entries are added only for findings triaged during CI gate
# iteration, each with a rationale and a review-by date. Blank lines and
# lines starting with # are ignored. Never bulk-ignore: every entry must be
# individually justified (unfixed upstream with no exploitable path in this
# stack, or a verified false positive). Real findings are fixed by bumping
# the dependency or changing code.
